{"4411890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RK Roulette", "steam_appid": 4411890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RISK YOUR LIFE, risk it however you want, play Russian roulette with up to 4 players simultaneously, with as many bullets as you want, the game mode you want, all the crazy settings that YOU want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras/8f7ca436749fa6a039ec2fd119d679f9.avif?t=1787821332\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras_big/8f7ca436749fa6a039ec2fd119d679f9.webp?t=1787821332 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or take risks by killing enemies in frantic waves of madness, which are also fully customizable, from bullet speed to obstacles you can use for cover yourself from the shooting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras/f05155160b55f13a369e1e1ca42231c6.avif?t=1787821332\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras_big/f05155160b55f13a369e1e1ca42231c6.webp?t=1787821332 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, you can purchase items on the black market to further customize your games and give them your own personal touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras/eca53aef719c78ba2d89dc3fa04bcfcb.avif?t=1787821332\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras_big/eca53aef719c78ba2d89dc3fa04bcfcb.webp?t=1787821332 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win matches and increase your streak, as well as earning “Online Balance” that you can use to purchase all kinds of items on the black market. (Rewards vary depending on how you customize your game.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras/bb689e4de97f09033a0a5abe754427fb.avif?t=1787821332\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras_big/bb689e4de97f09033a0a5abe754427fb.webp?t=1787821332 width=1560 height=853 /></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RISK YOUR LIFE, risk it however you want, play Russian roulette with up to 4 players simultaneously, with as many bullets as you want, the game mode you want, all the crazy settings that YOU want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras/8f7ca436749fa6a039ec2fd119d679f9.avif?t=1787821332\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras_big/8f7ca436749fa6a039ec2fd119d679f9.webp?t=1787821332 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or take risks by killing enemies in frantic waves of madness, which are also fully customizable, from bullet speed to obstacles you can use for cover yourself from the shooting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890/extras/f05155160b55f13a369e1e1ca42231c6.avif?t=1787821332\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411890